5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Since we have more residents than spaces, we need a fair way to decide. I think we should look at the history of how this was handled and any past issues.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"That sounds like a very sensible start, Misaki-san. It is always helpful to see how things were done before so we can all get along peacefully. I wonder what the others think?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"I agree! Let's keep it fair and friendly. I'm curious about the money side of things, though. We should probably check the finances so we don't get stuck with a bill we can't pay.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,George,,"I agree that fairness and financial stability are important. However, we must also consider the practical side of managing these spaces long-term. We shouldn't create a system that is too burdensome to maintain.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm excited to help! I've heard some people complaining that the same people always get the best spots, so I want to find out if that's actually true or just a misunderstanding!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with Mio. To understand the current situation and avoid future conflict, I'll look into the sticker register and the daily riders, as well as the five years of association minutes.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I think it would be helpful to see how people are actually using the spaces. I will look into the morning departures watched from the entrance and the rain exposure along the parking rows.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,I'll take the lead on the money! I'm going to check the building account's two-year ledger and the treasurer's handover file on cash collections. Let's see where the coins are actually going!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,George,,I will look into the treasurer's handover file on cash collections and the five years of association minutes. I want to see the actual workload involved in managing these arrangements over time.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,I'll check the sticker register and the daily riders to see who's actually using the spots! I also want to see last year's complaint log entries to see what people are really grumbling about!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"It seems we have a good distribution of research. Since we've all picked our items, I'm satisfied with the plan. I'll wait to see what the records reveal about our past disputes.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It is wonderful that we are all working together so harmoniously. I hope the information we find helps us create a space where everyone feels comfortable and cared for. I look forward to hearing your findings.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm just as excited as you are, Shizue-san! I'll be the one to uncover the financial secrets of our little building. I'm sure it'll be quite a revelation!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,George,,I believe we have covered the necessary ground. I will focus on the administrative history and the handover process to ensure our final decision is sustainable and doesn't fall apart due to lack of effort.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'm all set too! I can't wait to see if those complaints are real or just people being grumpy. Let's find some answers and make this fair for everyone!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I think we have a solid plan. Let's proceed with the research and reconvene to share what we've found. I hope we can find a solution that maintains the peace in our building.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree completely. Let us all take a look at our chosen records. I shall be thinking of everyone's happiness while I do my research. I will see you all very soon.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,I'm ready to dive in! I'll be back soon with all the juicy financial details. See you all in a bit—try not to miss me too much while I'm gone!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,George,,I agree. Let us proceed with the research. I will examine the documents carefully to ensure we don't overlook the practicalities of the management. I look forward to seeing what you all discover.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,Me too! I'm off to be a detective! I'll find out exactly what's going on with those parking spots. See you all soon!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
